  "worked_solution": "We can find the volume $V$ of the rectangular prism using the formula\n\n$$\nV=lwh,\n$$\n\nwhere $l$ is the length, $w$ is the width, and $h$ is the height of the solid.\n\nSubstituting \n\n$$\nV=105,\\,w=5,\\,h=7\n$$\n\ninto the formula, we obtain the following\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}105 & =l\\cdot 5\\cdot 7 \\\\ 105 & =35l \\\\ l & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the length is $3\\,\\text{cm}.$",
